<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isBudgetInformationOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is budget information of"@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isBudgetInformationOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/hasBudgetInformation> .
